---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { SIGN_UP_URL } from "../lib/site";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Pricing"
  description="Ashicore is free for six months for companies joining the launch program."
  path="/pricing"
>
    <main class="content-page">
    <p class="kicker">Launch program</p>
    <h1 class="page-title">Six months free for early customers.</h1>
    <p class="page-description">
      Ashicore is cutting-edge operating-core software for teams ready to run
      inventory, manufacturing, sales, purchasing, and planning in the AI era.
    </p>

    <section class="pricing-panel" aria-labelledby="pricing-offer">
      <div class="pricing-offer">
        <p class="pricing-price" id="pricing-offer">
          <span class="price-free">$0</span>
          <span class="price-was">$299/month</span>
        </p>
        <p class="price-term">
          Free for your first six months. After that, standard pricing is $299 per
          month unless we agree on a different plan before renewal.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button" href={SIGN_UP_URL}>
            Create account
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="pricing-proof" aria-label="Launch program details">
        <h2>Built with real operators. Now opening to more companies.</h2>
        <p>
          Ashicore was shaped in collaboration with real businesses solving
          real operational problems. The launch program gives qualified teams a
          direct path into the platform while the offer is available.
        </p>
        <ul class="pricing-list">
          <li>Full Ashicore service access during the first six months.</li>
          <li>Inventory, manufacturing, sales, purchasing, and planning workflows.</li>
          <li>Accounting handoff and agent-ready operational context.</li>
          <li>Direct onboarding path for companies adopting the platform now.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <article class="content-body">
      <h2>Why the offer exists</h2>
      <p>
        Ashicore was built in close collaboration with operators who needed
        modern business software for real inventory, production, sales, and
        purchasing workflows. We are now opening access beyond the initial
        pilot group.
      </p>
      <p>
        The six-month offer is simple: if Ashicore fits your operation, you get
        a serious head start on cutting-edge business software while the launch
        program is open.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
